; LowRider current axes: X short single motor, Y long dual motor. NO axis swap.
; Full reachable tool-center rectangle X-12.5..611.5 Y-10..1010 mm.
; Prepared for the current XY work offset 0,0. Preserve the current tool Z0.
; Cutter 6.35 mm. Work depth -0.100 mm. Cutting feed 2000 mm/min.
; Straight stepover 3.592 mm (56.57%); corner spacing <=5.07986 mm (<80%).
; FIRST CUTTING LAP IS SQUARE at all four exact travel corners.
; Then a rounded lap at the SAME perimeter before stepping inward: no corner gap.
; Constant 6 mm corner fillet, shrinking only to fit the final center strip.
; This avoids the old growing-radius crescent gaps. Center strip is cut explicitly.
; Cutter footprint overhangs the travel rectangle by up to 3.175 mm. Keep edges clear.
; Direct clearance-height move to starting corner with router OFF, then startup PAUSE.
; At PAUSE: check setup, turn router ON manually, then Resume. No spindle automation.
; No G28, G92, tool-zero reset, configuration change, or automatic start by upload.
